''What the consecration file held and nothing carries.'' `sortie`, `escrima` and `lua/LOCI` stood there as candidate grammar primitives and stand nowhere live. They read as deliberately dropped rather than lost, and this row exists so a later reader meets that as a decision rather than as a gap.

